# Xotik design system v2

## Aesthetic north star

Desi Pop Billboard (primary) + Vintage Indian Print + Cinematic mood. Loud, tactile, graphic — never generic cream SaaS.

## Colors

- Structural: `--paper`, `--ink`, `--line`, `--white`
- J spectrum: `--j-coral` through `--j-violet` — one dominant per scene, full-bleed fields not tiny dots
- Scene palettes: `--scene-street-*`, `--scene-factory-*`, `--scene-product-*`, `--scene-taste-*`, `--scene-manifesto-*`, `--scene-cta-*`
- Retro 70s: `--retro-mustard`, `--retro-terracotta`, `--retro-avocado`, `--retro-royal`, `--retro-fuchsia`, `--retro-petrol`
- Cinematic: `--cine-jaguar`, `--cine-red`, `--cine-gold`, `--cine-olive`

Use `.scene-shell[data-scene="…"]` on section roots. See `src/lib/scene-tokens.ts`.

## Typography (mixed stack)

- Billboard: `.font-condensed` (Bebas Neue) — huge uppercase headlines
- Devanagari hero: `.font-devanagari-display` — bilingual layers
- Receipt meta: `.font-receipt` — ingredients, barcodes, batch numbers
- Body: Manrope · Legacy display: Fraunces (use sparingly post-1.5)

## Textures

- `.texture-grain` — paper/print grain overlay
- `.texture-halftone` — Maaza-style dot pattern
- `.stamp-edge` — perforated stamp border
- `.sunburst-mark` — vintage sunburst accent

## CTAs

- `.btn-primary` — classic ink/pill (footer, subtle actions)
- `.btn-pop` — desi pop shadow button (hero, pitch moments)

## Do not

- Default every section to cream `--paper` background
- Use polite brochure copy — write billboard punch + gully hinglish
- Invent metrics, press quotes, or certification claims
- Copy user reference art pixels — mood and palette only
- AI-generate label text — use approved artwork only on 3D models
